#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ukraine-health.php
msgid "Ukraine Health – Hero Support"
msgstr "Ukraine Health – atbalsts Varoņiem"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: ukraine-health.php
msgid "https://github.com/kangarooo/ukraine-health"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: ukraine-health.php
msgid "Connects Heroes (patients in rehabilitation) with Supporters (hairdressers, nail care, clothing, care products, mobility aids…). Requests are grouped per hospital and service; when a group reaches its minimum size, matching Supporters are notified (email, Telegram, WhatsApp) and can accept it with an appointment date."
msgstr "Savieno Varoņus (pacientus rehabilitācijā) ar Atbalstītājiem (frizieri, manikīrs, apģērbs, kopšanas līdzekļi, pārvietošanās palīglīdzekļi…). Pieprasījumi tiek grupēti pēc slimnīcas un pakalpojuma; kad grupa sasniedz minimumu, atbilstošie Atbalstītāji saņem paziņojumu (e-pasts, Telegram, WhatsApp) un var to pieņemt ar vizītes datumu."

#. Author of the plugin
